{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The mighty of the awe-inspiring people (Israel) swear allegiance aloud: The Lord is King. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Those formed in lightning bless Thee aloud: The Lord has reigned. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The strong and lofty raise their voice aloud: The Lord will reign. The Lord is King, the Lord has reigned, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"15","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/quotations/refrain_3/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
