{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The mighty in strength pay homage aloud: The Lord has reigned. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Those enveloped in flames give thanks aloud: The Lord will reign. The Lord is King, the Lord has reigned, "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"chapter","n":"15","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/quotations/refrain_12/chapter"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
